{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Flames is a calm, atmospheric puzzle adventure where you guide two souls \u2014 Savitri and Satyavan \u2014 on a journey toward unity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move both characters across handcrafted hex-grid puzzles, explore soft low-poly environments, and discover a story inspired by myth, connection, and quiet moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Flames focuses on calm, peaceful puzzle-solving with soft movement and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.poster.avif?t=1768974995\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.webm?t=1768974995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.mp4?t=1768974995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Flames is built around harmony. Every puzzle asks you to think about how Savitri and Satyavan move together \u2014 sometimes in sync, sometimes independently, always connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flow through warm, gentle landscapes filled with soft lighting, subtle ambient effects, and serene music. Each area is designed to feel like a place you can breathe in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.poster.avif?t=1768974995\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.webm?t=1768974995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.mp4?t=1768974995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savitri and Satyavan travel through symbolic spaces that reflect distance, union, challenge, and emotional transformation. Their journey is quiet, minimalist, and told through gameplay, environments, and small world interactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing, pressure-free design</strong>\u00a0- No timers, no failure screens. Just peaceful puzzle logic.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control two characters - </strong>Move Savitri and Satyavan on a shared hex-grid and solve puzzles by positioning both correctly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted puzzles - </strong>Handcrafted puzzle progression designed for a calm and steady flow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful low-poly environments -</strong> Soft colors, gentle fog, and ambient lighting create a cozy, meditative world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist storytelling -</strong>\u00a0 A quiet emotional journey inspired by the idea of twin souls and harmony.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play at your own pace -\u00a0</strong>Smooth, gentle difficulty curve designed for a relaxing experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or paired play - </strong>Designed primarily for single-player, but can be shared locally between two people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera paths guide players gently through each puzzle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.poster.avif?t=1768974995\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.webm?t=1768974995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.mp4?t=1768974995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae TRY THE FREE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can already play the demo and experience the puzzle mechanics, atmosphere, and flow of the game. Your feedback helps shape the full release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9b WISHLIST TO SUPPORT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Flames is created by a solo developer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy calm puzzle games or relaxing atmospheric adventures, adding the game to your Steam wishlist helps a lot and supports development directly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to fan the flames? <strong>TWIN FLAMES</strong> launches soon\u2014wishlist now and let destiny call!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084560?t=1768974995","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/05cd93c97d23f46849c955fe3419f82adb9155f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768974995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/b9ae5eac3b862b25f4ba67b85f66af556da31f6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768974995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/b9ae5eac3b862b25f4ba67b85f66af556da31f6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768974995","categories